I just wanted to add a comment/question.  

It's been several years since I played hack so maybe I am missing some new
issues here.  But...

Why pay for things that are taken from the shop?  I use to kill a
leprochan(spell?) early on and then eat it.  This will randomly teleport
me all over the level (hence teleport out of shop after grabbing everything).  

This method does  make you walk around little more than necessary(?) and
cause you more food, but it sure beats paying for everything in the shop.

Of course, the shop keeper follows you around because you stole many goods 
and there is a good chance that you will accidently hit him  and you'll die...


